Placement Observatory

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Placement Observatory is an open-source, vendor-neutral observability runtime for reconstructing, explaining, replaying, and comparing AI workload placement decisions across heterogeneous compute, memory, topology, queue, capacity, and locality constraints.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Placement Observatory does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Placement Observatory accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
